## E0210 -- a @no_alloc function whose parameter has no proven range (its sum could need a heap cell).
## command: lume build   (this file shows the diagnostic: the gate runs a copy named .src; E0210_no_alloc_unbounded.fixed.src is the corrected program)
## fix: bound the parameters with requires
@no_alloc
fn f(x: int) -> int = x + 1
print f(1)
